{"identity_key": "bilibili:1272945845327626247", "source_id": "bilibili", "item_id": "1272945845327626247", "content": "fhána，这场中国城市演出暂成最后一次\n各位枣，《 #anemoi# 》ED《goldenfield》的原唱音乐组合 #fhána# 马上将于2026年11月29日来中国香港举办“fhána 15th Anniversary Tour 2026 ‘Worldlines’ in HongKong”演唱会。而就在昨天，该演唱会的主办方 NEON LIT MUSIC 官宣：fhána将在完成这场演出后，暂停在日本以外的任何地方举办演出，也因此，这场演唱会将「暂时成为fhána接下来一段时间内“最后一场”在中国各大城市乃至日本以外任何地方举办的演出」。\n\n目前这场演唱会的VIP门票均已售罄，但售价580港币（*不含额外手续费）的普通门票仍可在 https://www.tickets.neon-lit.com/ja/fhana-worldlines2026 购买。", "publisher": "StuartRiki_鍵視", "canonical_url": "https://www.bilibili.com/opus/1272945845327626247", "published_at": "2026-11-21T00:00:00+00:00", "published_precision": "second", "fetched_at": "2026-11-21T15:28:21.341622+00:00", "media": [{"type": "image", "url": "http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/new_dyn/120bbaa6094604081fbd7afef4ec81a439471072.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "url": "http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/new_dyn/5d60cd9ca67e0fc5294b0024c3e2fb3739471072.png"}], "metadata": {"account": "bili_39471072", "uid": "39471072", "dynamic_type": "DYNAMIC_TYPE_DRAW", "title": "fhána，这场中国城市演出暂成最后一次", "is_retweet": false, "is_reply": false, "is_quote": false, "stats": {"likes": 122, "retweets": 1, "replies": 0}, "provider": "web-dynamic/feed-space", "route": "anonymous-buvid", "tag": "B站Gal"}}
